        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-amber-900 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-lg p-3 max-w-md">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 text-amber-600" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M8.257 3.099c.765-1.36 2.722-1.36 3.486 0l5.58 9.92c.75 1.334-.213 2.98-1.742 2.98H4.42c-1.53 0-2.493-1.646-1.743-2.98l5.58-9.92zM11 13a1 1 0 11-2 0 1 1 0 012 0zm-1-8a1 1 0 00-1 1v3a1 1 0 002 0V6a1 1 0 00-1-1z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
          </svg>
          <span>防骗提醒：切勿相信任何所谓“永久免费不限速”噱头，警惕跑路风险，建议月付或季付为宜。</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: Quick Links -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-800 mb-3">精选评测专栏</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li><a href="/#ranking" class="hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors">2026 稳定机场推荐总榜</a></li>
          <li><a href="/posts/clash-verge-tutorial/" class="hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors">Clash Verge 全平台上手教程</a></li>
          <li><a href="/posts/vless-hysteria2-tuic-protocols/" class="hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors">Hysteria 2 vs TUIC 延迟对比</a></li>
